<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    THE SELECT POPUP — the flyout that replaces every single-choice AlertDialog
    (handoff README §6, «Выбор из списка»). Inflated and driven by
    com.v2ray.ang.ui.component.SelectPopup; a screen never inflates it directly.

    Applies to: Режим · DNS · Пинг · Оформление · Язык · Автообновление подписки ·
    Доменная стратегия · Интервал · Сортировка.

    The body is a plain LinearLayout and NOT a MaterialCardView, for one reason
    that matters: a MaterialCardView clips its children to its own outline, and
    §11 grabl 4 is precisely a flyout being clipped by the surface it lives on.
    A shape background plus elevation gives the same fill, corner, stroke and
    shadow with nothing that can trim the content.

    Geometry, every number from §6 and each one confirmed against the prototype:
      body     padding @dimen/select_popup_padding 6, radius 16, 1dp colorOutline,
               solid colorSurfaceContainerHighest, elevation 20 (the «тень 20×44»)
      width    set by SelectPopup from @dimen/select_popup_w_* — sized to the
               LONGEST option so the body never reflows when the choice changes
      position top 48 / right 8 from the anchor row's top-right corner

    The reveal is a CLIP from top to bottom over @integer/motion_popup 260 plus
    opacity over @integer/motion_popup_fade 180 — never a scale, which
    re-rasterises the option labels and makes them judder (§6).
-->
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:id="@+id/select_popup"
    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
    android:background="@drawable/bg_select_popup"
    android:clipChildren="false"
    android:clipToPadding="false"
    android:elevation="@dimen/select_popup_elevation"
    android:orientation="vertical"
    android:padding="@dimen/select_popup_padding" />
